Please don't throw daggers while you are engulfed by an energy vortex
as an archeologist.  Throwing 1 dagger per turn while engulfed is a bad
idea.

My archeologists like to use broad picks (dwarvish mattock).  A +0
Broad pick does an average of 11.5 damage to an energy vortex, compared
to the 4.5 damage the +0 scimitar does.

Yes, the broad pick is 2-handed, but by the time you fight monsters
that can curse your inventory, you should be able to two-weapon combat
some good weapons.  However, before you can do mass damage with
two-weapon combat, the broad pick is a great idea.



